#: ../../../../../../../home/luke/Documents/qilisdk/docs/modules/backends/backends_qilisim.rst:2
msgid "QiliSim"
msgstr "QiliSim"

#: ../../../../../../../home/luke/Documents/qilisdk/docs/modules/backends/backends_qilisim.rst:14
msgid ""
"The **QiliSim** backend is the default CPU simulator developed by "
"Qilimanjaro and written in C++. It implements every primitive functional "
"natively, supports a noise model on all execution paths, and is included "
"with the core ``qilisdk`` installation — no extra dependency or hardware "
"is required."
msgstr ""
"El backend **QiliSim** és el simulador de CPU per defecte desenvolupat "
"per Qilimanjaro i escrit en C++. Implementa tots els funcionals primitius"
" de manera nativa, suporta un model de soroll en totes les rutes "
"d'execució i s'inclou amb la instal·lació principal de ``qilisdk`` — no "
"requereix cap dependència ni maquinari addicional."

#: ../../../../../../../home/luke/Documents/qilisdk/docs/modules/backends/backends_qilisim.rst:19
